content_en:
The two men fought for a very short time, but they caused great damage!
All matter within nearly several star sectors has been annihilated, the laws are disordered, and it is difficult to repair...
Although Fan Wu and other demon supremes were vulnerable to Chu Yuan, they could still do it by simply avoiding the aftermath;
However, it was impossible to explore the specific scene of the fight between the demon god and Chu Yuan, so he just retreated again and again!
In the end, the divine light disappears and everything returns to peace;
The demon god put away his spear and stepped out of the void.
Seeing that his aura had not weakened much, Fanwu breathed a sigh of relief and quickly stepped forward and asked: "Sir! That Chu Yuan..."
"He can't do anything to me, so he has retreated for now."
"..." After hearing this answer, Fanwu was stunned for a moment;
Does that mean you can't do anything to him?
The demon god glanced at him and raised the corners of his mouth slightly: "I want to retreat, please wait...and don't stay too far away from me;
Just in case Chu Yuan takes it out on you. "
Yuehun tentatively said: "Sir... you seem to be in a good mood?"
"Haha, Chu Yuan will definitely be defeated..."
The demon god stepped into the strange realm, leaving behind a bunch of confused demon supremes;
Moko said uncertainly: "Did the Demon God find out the details about Chu Yuan during this battle?"
"I hope so..."
.......
In a deserted place on the edge of the universe, Chu Yuan walked out of the void again;
The Killing Supreme asked: "Why did you leave so suddenly?"
Chu Yuan shook his head and sighed: "In order to please the will of the universe, the demon god suddenly made a sudden move to clear the third battlefield;
Supreme Kong Yan scolded them... and they were brutally attacked.
I couldn't save him, but I was able to vent some of his anger and went to kill two demon supremes..."
Killing was startled, with a hint of sadness on his face;
He was originally a newly promoted Supreme, and was not familiar with Kongyan Supreme;
But I also knew that this man had a strong character... I didn't expect that he would die so easily in the hands of the demon god.
"In this case, we need to inform other people and let them be more careful."
Chu Yuandao: "There is no need to make people panic."
"How do you say this?"
"If my prediction is correct, the Demon God should have gone into seclusion by now;
For a while, it will no longer be active. "Chu Yuan raised the corners of his mouth slightly and did not explain too much to Killing.
I'm afraid, the demon god's heart is full of 'hope' to defeat him right now, right?
‘Hope’ is something very abstract;
It can have no power, or it can have infinite power!
When they fought just now, Chu Yuan had planted 'hope' in the demon god's heart...
The Order of Hope, the legacy that the Supreme Light had entrusted to him, could not be expected to come into play at this time.
